# scripts/wallet-e2e.sh on the Mac mini (Apple M4), 2026-11-04, branch lez-0.4 (accounts and
# fees, module 0.12.0). Prebuilt LEZ v0.4.0-rc1 sequencer_service --features standalone, fresh
# chain on 127.0.0.1:3230 (stopped at the end). Binaries built from this branch with the local
# risc0 toolchain. About 21 minutes, 12 of them the registry's commitment wait, overlapped with
# the token and testimonial steps. Unedited from the first step on (the build output before it
# is left out). Nothing below is secret: F is LEZ's published local-test account, the rest are
# throwaway keys on a chain that no longer exists.
#
